From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:35:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Appointments sold on its own in Lite, Standard and Pro

Owner 2026-11-04: the booking portal sold like Loyalty and Content, at the
same prices and trial, with its own packages. A migration adds the feature
max_booking_staff (team members clients can book: 2, 5, 15), the products
appointments and booking where a database lacks them, and 21 hidden,
unpriced plans: appointments_lite / appointments / appointments_pro at
49 / 85 / 149 EUR a month (15 % less yearly, 7-day trial), and Appointments
with Loyalty or Content in every pair of packages at the sum of the two.
An appointments plan that is already sold is left as it is and logged.

Sell them with php artisan stripe:sync --module-plans --publish.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AxwcUrbmDjGnph8B93vTpQ
